gcc-14 O0/O2: exit 0/0.
clang-19 O0/O2: exit 0/0; the unnamed definition parameter emits its existing
extension warning. Its bound is still evaluated, just as for a named one.
Multidimensional arrays and pointer-to-array parameters capture their inner
sizes once at entry; prototypes and nested callback prototypes do not run
their bound expressions. Independent inline expansions and recursive frames
retain their own sizes after the source parameters change.
